            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To subtract two fractions with like denominators, we subtract the numerators and keep the denominators the same. Therefore,</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (3)/(7) \u2212 (1)/(7) = (3 \u2212 1)/(7) = (2)/(7).]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "To subtract two fractions with like denominators, we subtract the numerators and keep the denominators the same. Therefore,\n\n[MATH: (3)/(7) \u2212 (1)/(7) = (3 \u2212 1)/(7) = (2)/(7).]",
