        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nFind the value of [MATH: \\dfrac 3 7 - \\dfrac 1 7.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nTo subtract two fractions with like denominators, we subtract the numerators and keep the denominators the same. Therefore,\n\n[MATH: (3)/(7) \u2212 (1)/(7) = (3 \u2212 1)/(7) = (2)/(7).]"
